{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c76c0111-799b-5157-9bb8-1ab937fd1927", "source_ordinal": 2019, "reading_ordinal": 2037, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "兰花指", "published_at": "2023-09-13T17:28:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/619408417/answer/3209665157"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "遇到暗示，最好的处理手段就是抓住对方毫无准备的时候直截了当的问出来：“我感觉到你有xxxx的意思，这是我的错觉，还是你确实有这个意思？”", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是二选一。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果回答“确实有这个意思”，你就获得了采取对应行动的正当性，而不再像之前有“仅仅是因为疑心就yyyy”的“总是过度反应”的问题。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你自己说出来了，就不是我疑神疑鬼，周围的人也就不会因为你采取的行动ta们看不懂动机而本能的往诡秘恶意方向揣测。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果回答“我没这个意思，是你自己误会/脑补”，那么你接下去不要去控诉“你没这个意思？！你没这个意思那你为什么这样、又那样、又那那样？！”——这是个错误的应对。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你应该直接接：“OK，那么可不可以请你注意避免以下这些容易引起误会的做法？我知道这可能令你不方便，但对我确实困扰很大，所以希望你费点心。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "比如，请在xxx的时候，不要yyy。如果你确实要yyy，可以zzz这样稍微变一下，这样我就知道不是这个意思了。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "又比如，aaa，可以多给我一个提前通知，以免我们无意间起误会。”", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "余下以此类推。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "总的立场是——你说不是，那就不是，我完全相信你。而且我相信我们之间是友好关系，你也希望我们的关系更健康、更和谐，那么采取以下小改变就可以解决很多很大的误会，而且我不认为你有义务要配合这些建议，而是认为你如果肯配合这些建议那就太感谢了。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "看似这是和缓温柔的立场，但实际上这是一种强力的管理。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为对方说不得“不”。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 600}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "对这么温柔的请求说不，在所有人眼里——包括其本人心里——都是极大的忌讳。", "char_start": 601, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "旁观者其实非常清楚现在发生的是什么事——你痛快答应，你才是真的心底无私；你如果不同意，那么问题就来了——你至少是一个很难共存的人。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你是否会掩藏小心思是其次，在交往中配合对方的合理请求是一切人与人交往的最基本的友善。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这看似不算是绝对义务，但是你要记住，也没有任何人有绝对义务非要跟你合作、跟你来往、给你机会。一个对这样的请求都说不的人，合作成本显然很高，大家又不是日子过得太好要给自己找不痛快，就这一条看在眼里，自然默默的就抛弃你了。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 856}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你说出这个不来，你就自己破坏了你自己的社会关系。", "char_start": 857, "char_end": 881}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "第二，你说不，那我就会停止拜托你改变，我就获得了自己调整关系的合理立场。我给过你机会，你自己不要，那就别抱怨接下来的待遇了。", "char_start": 882, "char_end": 944}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "换言之，其实我何止不怕你说不，我还有点盼着你说不。你说了不，我才好合理合法的抬升你的生存成本，让你以后见到我、跟我说话、从我这里得到任何反馈的成本都全面提高。", "char_start": 945, "char_end": 1024}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "对方只要不是蠢到失去知觉，自然知道哪怕是骗人，也要说是。", "char_start": 1025, "char_end": 1053}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你说是，不管你是真的还是假的，承诺就已经成立了。那么下次你再犯，我就有你的明确承诺作为诉求的依据，你就有一个信用成本要支付。", "char_start": 1054, "char_end": 1116}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而无论你点头摇头，这种正面点穿本身就有显著意义：", "char_start": 1117, "char_end": 1141}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "1）这是在告诉你我是没什么忌讳的，我敢于给你正面点穿。而且我现在选择的场合已经很客气，我要是对你的作为感到不满，我完全可以提升到更高的级别再给你正面质询。听到这个质询的人会更多，你说不的代价会更大。", "char_start": 1142, "char_end": 1241}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "2）听到这些的旁人立刻自动在心里给你做了备案，开始自动监管你的这个问题和你自己的后效。", "char_start": 1242, "char_end": 1285}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "即使在你上道说是这个最佳的表现下，周围的人也会给你打上“这人可能缺少这类界限意识”的黄色警告记号。ta人的这种警惕本身就是对你的威慑。", "char_start": 1286, "char_end": 1353}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你如果再犯，我在这些人面前再次提出这个疑问，让这些人明白你根本就不是无意的，而是故意的，而且上次还是当着这些人的面撒谎，这次你再说什么都没意义了。", "char_start": 1354, "char_end": 1427}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "再往深处想想——你是不是没有料到我会主动出击？", "char_start": 1428, "char_end": 1451}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "既然你没有料到我这次的主动出击，你之后再做别的小动作，动手之前有把握猜中我会给你什么其他惊喜吗？", "char_start": 1452, "char_end": 1500}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "搞暗示战术的前提是局面的可预测性。现在我直接摧毁你的“可预测性”基石，你的大脑自然会拉住你下次冲动的手。", "char_start": 1501, "char_end": 1553}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "换言之，这一番温柔的请求，其实是一种一反手就能摧毁你的社会关系网络的二段杀。", "char_start": 1555, "char_end": 1593}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "看到我这个拈花而立的起手式，你最好知道收敛。", "char_start": 1594, "char_end": 1616}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "我既然知道站在这个暴风眼的位置上，且有这种能力完美的管理我的情绪，精确到标点符号的放出这一记兰花拂穴手，你是明白人，你知道利害。", "char_start": 1617, "char_end": 1681}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你放心，会玩暗示把戏的人，当然懂得这兰花指力。因为ta那些“暗示”，本身就是这门功夫的学前班的科目。", "char_start": 1682, "char_end": 1732}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "ta只是没练到这一步罢了。", "char_start": 1733, "char_end": 1746}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "问题不在于这个办法本身有没有效，而在于你自己有没有这个勇气和控制力。", "char_start": 1747, "char_end": 1781}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0303"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：爸爸对我有那种想法怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“兰花指”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“遇到暗示，最好的处理手段就是抓住对方毫无准备的时候直截了当的问出来：“我感觉到你有xxxx的意思，这是我的错觉，还是你确实有这个意思？””", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "遇到暗示，最好的处理手段就是抓住对方毫无准备的时候直截了当的问出来：“我感觉到你有xxxx的意思，这是我的错觉，还是你确实有这个意思？”", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f42bdddc-cd53-55ab-9f5c-a144ba83583e", "source_ordinal": 2018, "reading_ordinal": 2038, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "补天士", "published_at": "2023-09-14T23:12:25+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/620586432/answer/3211543459"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "只说一条：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "有没有人考虑过做“有害成分快速检测试纸”的生意？", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "必然大卖。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个话你们记住，对人生有重大好处——", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "从个人而言，遇到自己不钟意的社会趋势，最有效的应对手段是找一门合理、合法又赚钱的“给这个趋势打补丁”的生意做。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "注意，这个说的不是“给这个趋势唱反调”的生意，而是“打补丁”的生意——也就是如果这趋势之中存在什么恐慌，你的生意可以安抚这个恐慌；有什么不好的可能性，你的生意可以降低这个可能性；有何不良的后果，你的生意可以抑制这个后果。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 222}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这没有任何道德问题，也不会与任何人为敌，相对来说风险不大，而对你自己本人则有良好的祝福。", "char_start": 223, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这才是为人处世的首选正路，而不是遇到自己不喜欢的就去反对、反对、再反对。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 304}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这不是说你“无权反对”，而是在告诉你无论再怎么有效，纯反对都基本上是消耗性的亏本生意。", "char_start": 305, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你并没有很多本钱可亏。", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "做人多补天，少逆天。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "补天会有钱。", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "撇开有钱不谈，你回转头考虑考虑——因为新事物有风险、有挑战，就一概反对，这反对到何时是个头？啥东西没有可拿来一说的风险和成本？", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "历史滚滚向前，每一步都是以这种纯反对最终失败为前提的。", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你只有站补天士的位，你才有希望成为下一轮历史的股东。", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你站逆天士的位，有哪个童话故事是以“因为大家的反对，历史又倒了回去，从此大家幸福的生活在过去”为结尾的？", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 550}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "有吗？", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 554}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0303"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待预制菜进入校园？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“补天士”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“只说一条：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "只说一条：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f5c5597b-348f-5332-a262-8dc6b577213b", "source_ordinal": 2017, "reading_ordinal": 2039, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "唯一错误选择", "published_at": "2023-09-15T12:31:20+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/619981295/answer/3212165822"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "游泳要在水里学，没有水，游泳学得不好是理所当然的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "第一，现在的生活比以前的确好得多了。父母一个月赚几十块钱，每餐都不能保证有肉甚至有干米饭的时代的确是一去不复返了。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那个年代，左邻右舍时不时就有人死亡。小学同学里几乎肯定有活不到成年的。每个村、每个镇、每个厂区，都会有被叫作“疯子”“大傻”而说不清真名的精神病患者或者痴呆患者在路边冲人傻笑。更早的年代那就更惨烈，各种意外死亡、失踪就更多，生活温饱的可能性更低。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "相比之下，考试没考好，被人骂了几句，这都是非常日常的事，几乎没人会放在心上——会放在心上的，早祖宗八辈就亡了，被人批评几句就要死，顺治年咋过的，道光年咋过的，太平天国咋过的，光绪年咋过的？抗战咋过的？……对中国近现代史有哪怕一丁点基本认知，都知道要脆弱也轮不到ta来脆弱。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "第二，现在的社会生存方式隐私性很高。以前在一个村子里家长里短，的确是很八卦。但八卦的一大好处是别家的风光你知，别家的困窘你也知。家家有本难念的经，于是你这本难念也就一般难念了。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "现在左邻右舍最大的接触就是在地下车库看到对方鲜衣墨镜面无表情开着自己的Volvo SUV出门，或者碰到对方的父母领着小娃在花园里跑。除此之外，最多就是朋友圈、业主群偶尔看到谁吵几句。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "只有风光可见，没有困窘可睹，于是就变成只有你家有难念的经了，你要一起长吁短叹都找不到同病相怜的真人。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "只有唯恐天下不乱，中国不垮的网军和流量鳄鱼是你的新知心人，ta们只会在你耳边念“错的不是你，是整个世界”这种有毒的屁话。", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以，你连脚都没打湿过，甚至都没见过人游泳，你的游泳技能当然稀烂。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这本来怪不着你，但是千不该、万不该，你不该把你脆弱的原因推到“世道严酷”上。", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 710}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "老一辈听到这种鬼话就会对你丧失一切同情。", "char_start": 711, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "本来你的问题无非是没工作、没人指点、没人给你订单、没人接纳你，这些资源对这些已经站稳脚跟的社会成员来说都不是问题——总不是要找人来工作的？总不是要接纳某些人的？总不是要培养几个新人的？订单总不是迟早要给几个新供应商试试的？", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但是一个人，自己因为时代原因而脆弱也就罢了，还要完全不顾事实的把自身脆弱的原因推卸到“时代残酷”上。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "可笑，我们都是四五十年一路亲身过过来的，这个时代“残酷”？", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 924}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这个时代还“残酷”？行，你说“残酷”就“残酷”吧，都是“个人观点，无所谓对错”。", "char_start": 925, "char_end": 965}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "但是，同样的工作机会、订单和指点，我认为还是拿来培养那些不这么归因的新人为好。因为这些人很显然的要比“时代残酷论”者们更能承担个人的成长责任，更不容易浪费机会。", "char_start": 966, "char_end": 1046}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "谁不希望同样一百万的单子，做完之后多出一个可靠而优秀的供应商？谁希望单子不但做得稀里哗啦，做完之后对方还觉得“给我的压力太大了”，要回家抑郁两年？", "char_start": 1047, "char_end": 1120}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "任何问题的提出和解决，都不要只在一个所谓“纯学术”的虚拟空间里寻求，它必须还被同时放在“它将如何影响我自身的生存”的现实空间里，用放大镜盯着考察。", "char_start": 1121, "char_end": 1194}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "前者的使命往往不是给你“正确答案”，而仅仅是给你“若干不为错误的候选结论”，真正决定你应该选择哪个结论的是第二层面的讨论。", "char_start": 1195, "char_end": 1256}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "只是这个安排存在一个巨大的缺陷——当一个人思维能力孱弱、思想幼稚、意识狭隘的时候，学术空间的探索ta常常只能摸索到一个候选结论，导致在第二现实空间的表决时根本没有可选择的余地，而就这唯一的一个所谓“候选真理”，本身都还是站不住脚的残次品。", "char_start": 1257, "char_end": 1376}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "只能被迫咽下唯一的残次品，而且是不断的反复强咽，是人一步步滑向生存危机的思想机制的本质。", "char_start": 1377, "char_end": 1421}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而导致人思维能力残疾，沦落到每次都只能强咽唯一残缺答案的祸根，就在于人的ego——那个自义道德虚荣。", "char_start": 1422, "char_end": 1472}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "任何结论，只要隔着十万八千里暗示“问题可能出在自己身上”，当事人都不会等到它形成可供审思的表达，就在草稿阶段把它撕毁了。所有的智力资源都专注在寻找“错如何不在我身上”方向的结论。", "char_start": 1473, "char_end": 1562}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这经常导致寻找结论时的基本逻辑上的困难，导致哪怕拼凑出一个都千辛万苦，当然是勉强拼凑出一个能骗得过自己的就赶紧收工了。", "char_start": 1563, "char_end": 1622}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "得到的当然就是这种“唯一残缺候选”。", "char_start": 1623, "char_end": 1641}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "以前你不知道，现在你知道了。", "char_start": 1642, "char_end": 1656}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0303"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：昨天我们这里一个十三岁的女孩跳楼了，为什么现在的年轻人心理承受能力如此差？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“唯一错误选择”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“游泳要在水里学，没有水，游泳学得不好是理所当然的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "游泳要在水里学，没有水，游泳学得不好是理所当然的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7ff86c65-a7c6-59a8-a272-e4ed6108cb73", "source_ordinal": 2016, "reading_ordinal": 2040, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "神娱乐", "published_at": "2023-09-16T20:19:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/621466828/answer/3214011412"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "娱乐应该定时安排，视为定时吃饭、定时睡觉一样的生活必备内容，根本不该随所谓的“今朝有酒”、“日子过得好/不好”这类条件而改变。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "最多随经济条件好坏切换一下不同的形式，但安排总是要安排的。别人不安排，你就自己安排。没有理想的条件，你就安排点门槛低的——比如吹吹口哨，讲讲笑话。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "唯一的忌讳，是别人如果接受不了——比如正在服丧——你就不要当着别人的面就行了。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "随时随地娱乐自己和娱乐ta人的能力是一种很重要——甚至很根本的能力。从某种角度上讲，爱的能力本身就可以被视为一种娱人的能力。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你很难想象一个不好玩的人有很强的爱人的能力。不然难道整天“神圣而苦难”，“伟大的牺牲”？", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我抓把泥巴都能发明个规则出来跟你玩一下午你信不信？你把我嘴捂上手捆上，我就靠一双眼溜溜转都能让你哈哈出来你信不信？", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "严厉的批评一般都是让被批评的人哇哇哭到笑出来的批评。挨骂归挨骂，但是ta就不能不服你骂得真tm绝，连ta自己想想都憋不住。", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“Entertain”，“娱乐”，现在常被污名化，被认为是“正事”的“妨碍”，但是它们的起源却其实是神圣的——ta们都来自神圣的祭礼，何止不被认为是“浪费时间”，还被认为是必不可少、不容忽视的大典。过年、中秋、元宵、七夕、清明、端午……是法定娱乐，是对社会不容轻忽的节期，这对你有什么启发？最直观的——过年哭丧着脸，在你家不会挨骂吗？", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不会玩，不好玩的人，人跟ta呆着都难受，还谈什么别的呢？谁要你这种天天跟上坟一样悲催哭丧的“爱”？", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "话说到这份上，你还会觉得对待快乐、对待娱乐，是所谓“今朝有酒今朝罪”和“过得不好才会及时行乐”二选一的问题吗？", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 680}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "说得不客气点，这两种态度都是鬼扯淡的病态行为。", "char_start": 681, "char_end": 704}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "今朝没酒，也不爱醉，就不不独乐乐且与众乐乐了？过得充满希望，雄心勃勃，就不独乐乐且与众乐乐了？", "char_start": 705, "char_end": 752}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "凭啥？为什么？难道还非要遇到“满足上述特殊条件”才敢相信“娱乐一下”是“情有可原”的？因为只有这样才不至于“妈见打”，是吗？", "char_start": 753, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "其实错的是“妈”们，但你不需要跟ta们理论，你只管保持自己的快乐和身边人的快乐就可以了。", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 860}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "自娱娱人是优良的品质，也是你要下定决心掌握的基本技能，哪怕纯功利的讲，也不比“学习好”的重要性低。", "char_start": 861, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "娱乐本身不是无关紧要的，娱乐的能力也不是“有害的奇技淫巧”。恰恰相反，娱乐是人理所当然应该享受的快乐之一，是不应该缺少、哪怕没条件也要创造性的完成的追求。娱乐的能力是每一个立志爱人的人所必备的能力。", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 1010}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "绝不是相反。", "char_start": 1011, "char_end": 1017}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这跟勤劳、勇敢、牺牲没有任何矛盾，也不应该有矛盾。", "char_start": 1018, "char_end": 1043}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这不是“功成名就“之后才该去考虑的“荣华富贵”，而是应该贯穿你每时每刻的一层色彩。", "char_start": 1044, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "高喊乌拉向着敌人的枪林弹雨冲锋时，老子已经想好了跟孙子说的相声段子。", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1120}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "无时不乐，何来“及时行乐”？", "char_start": 1121, "char_end": 1135}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0303"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：李雪琴说「日子过得不好的时候，才说今朝有酒今朝醉」，你认同吗？生活过的不好，人会更想要「及时行乐」吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“神娱乐”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“娱乐应该定时安排，视为定时吃饭、定时睡觉一样的生活必备内容，根本不该随所谓的“今朝有酒”、“日子过得好/不好”这类条件而改变。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "娱乐应该定时安排，视为定时吃饭、定时睡觉一样的生活必备内容，根本不该随所谓的“今朝有酒”、“日子过得好/不好”这类条件而改变。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 63, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5fc776f0-0504-5cc8-9c74-ae2e3ab34633", "source_ordinal": 2015, "reading_ordinal": 2041, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "丧气话", "published_at": "2023-09-17T03:13:22+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/281756338/answer/3214348555"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这种部落文化大概可以分两种——，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一种是抬高格调，不断的炫耀物质或者智力的的条件，对不适应者形成排挤效应，从而保持小圈子里的同调性。这个主要适用于一些封闭的“私人俱乐部”。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "另一种则是压低格调，比着赛的卖惨哭穷，从而保持自身的“谦卑性”，避免受到任何未知者的嫉妒和攻击。约等于不管三七二十一，先伏低做小，站好“贫下中农”的位置，保证任何人跟自己为难都会被视为“欺负可怜人”，可以随时拉起其他“可怜人”的同仇敌忾，发起自卫甚至反击。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "后一个就是“丧文化”背后的动力学成因。基本上任何一个无门槛、高流动的社交圈子里都会自然而然的流行起这个风气——因为你无法预料这个圈子里新来的新人是什么底细，也不知道ta们是什么性格、有什么心结，在这种一切未知的条件下，保持低调、不引人瞩目——尤其是不引人妒忌——是高于一切的安全守则。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这其实是一种自我保护本能在舆论风气上的体现，并不真的表达什么经济状况或者社会发展情况。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你听ta哭得惨、说得丧，其实那是人家自己抹的保护色，陪你客气一下免得惹麻烦而已。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这跟班上一聊就都在“躺平”、“摆烂”，结果大四一看就你没毕业证、没offer一样，属于自己平时就要知道警惕的幻觉。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 501}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0303"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么「丧文化」在年轻人中这么流行？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“丧气话”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这种部落文化大概可以分两种——，”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这种部落文化大概可以分两种——，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "dc94cc21-fa55-5202-9e3b-81d5ab2389f6", "source_ordinal": 2014, "reading_ordinal": 2042, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "拆散", "published_at": "2023-09-18T04:20:44+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/541617240/answer/3215580840"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实很简单，请女儿带对方来吃顿饭见个面就行了——大部分的小孩都扛不住“见对方父母”这个压力。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "只要父母以有心算无心，请对方在高级酒楼见面，自己穿着高雅，言谈客气，礼貌有加，就会对小朋友产生强大的社交压力。到时候言语稍微撩拨两句，微妙的推动一下气氛，就可以刺激到小孩子强烈的“自尊心”，触发对方防御心理的大发作。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但是现场从礼节上根本挑不出两老的错——无论从什么角度看，那些问题都是无比正当的问题。怎么，你的事业打算问不得？你的“生意构想”质疑不得？三推两推，就可以刺激得小男生跳起来无礼，到时候两老只需要“顾全体面，委曲求全”，你的宝贝女儿事后势必要跟他翻脸。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "她的父母何等尊贵，如此折节迁就，礼下于人，只不过问了几个与自己女儿命运直接相关的正当问题，就要受此凌辱，这段关系有没有必要继续下去，还需要你们去劝服女儿吗？", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "要是药效不够，还可以在女儿隔壁委屈的哭几声。以大小姐的高傲性子，不把小男生的全部联系方式拉黑才怪。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "话说回来，这小孩要是面对这个场合，不逞强，也不自卑，进退有礼而又不失尊严，那就是凭本事赢的，那就有资格留校察看。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这其实是“公平决斗”，谈不上欺负人。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "巧妙的激化自己不喜欢的对象与子女间的矛盾，让ta们关系经不起考验的一面提前面对严峻的考验而自行暴露出来，这才是父母看守大门的正道，而不是跑去寻死觅活的逼着女儿这样那样什么的。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 573}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这没什么不好意思的——一点委屈都受不得，一点“怠慢”就觉得奇耻大辱，面对强势者不懂得向上管理，遇到挫折就对爱人泄愤撒气，这本来就是不适格，并没有什么陷害可言。", "char_start": 574, "char_end": 653}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而且“不但有问题，还绝对说不得”是小孩子的通病，九成九一刺激就会发作，一发作就会祛魅，女儿的幻想立刻就会被原形毕露的小男生亲手毁灭，这比父母去施压管用一万倍。", "char_start": 654, "char_end": 733}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "父母只是要注意掌握分寸，每一次的刺激都要无把柄可抓，保证都是绝对正当、以父母身份无懈可击的正常行为即可，这样就不至于刺激女儿的同情心，觉得男神受了“暗算”要跟你拼命。", "char_start": 734, "char_end": 817}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "整个过程都要让女儿自己纠结“难道连这也算过分”。", "char_start": 818, "char_end": 842}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "“如果连这都叫对你过分，对你都算侮辱、轻蔑，要被你反击、报复、那么跟你一起生活半辈子是个什么下场？”", "char_start": 843, "char_end": 893}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这个问题要让女儿自己挥之不去的去辗转反侧。多失眠几天，必生质问，这个质问十之八九会命中男生的脆弱点，非有真正的爱，这种质问一般都会以崩盘分手为结局。", "char_start": 894, "char_end": 968}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "其实都别说小孩子现场按捺不住发作，就是做得有些让女儿觉得丢了面子，事后女儿都少不得要埋怨他。", "char_start": 969, "char_end": 1015}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "现在的小孩那个傲慢心哪受得了这个，什么“一家都是势利眼”“就是看不起我”之类的“正义之言”自然会冲口而出。这些话一落地，这个机缘就断绝了，环氧树脂都粘不拢，哪怕怀了孕都会打掉。", "char_start": 1016, "char_end": 1104}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "是不是看了汗毛直竖？", "char_start": 1105, "char_end": 1115}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "汗毛竖什么？因为看出来就是明摆着告诉你，堂而皇之的阳谋摆在你面前，你也感觉自己扛不住吗？", "char_start": 1116, "char_end": 1160}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这些“招数”真的就那么卑劣吗？怎么？不允许对方父母关心女儿的对象的事业和打算？不允许ta们试探你的人品？非要人家打好包双手奉上才行？", "char_start": 1161, "char_end": 1227}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你想得美！", "char_start": 1228, "char_end": 1233}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你过得了这关，那人父母就无话可说。", "char_start": 1234, "char_end": 1251}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你过不了这关，你又有什么话可说？一个连这关都过不去的人，有什么资格去给女方打那些包票？", "char_start": 1252, "char_end": 1295}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你不反省自己道行有欠，而要去抱怨别人试炼的权利？", "char_start": 1296, "char_end": 1320}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "那你更不够格，而且没有一丝冤枉。", "char_start": 1321, "char_end": 1337}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "评论区有很多小朋友觉得这“很好搞定”，以为只是油滑一点、“忍辱负重”一点的事，还有打算用“找理由不去”这类技巧来推搪、用“朋友串通”，或者“跨行业吹牛”来“解决问题”的。", "char_start": 1338, "char_end": 1423}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这些想法连基本方向都不对。", "char_start": 1424, "char_end": 1437}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这些想法是想靠某种装出来的实力“折服”对方父母，一开始就在假设“目标”具有“可折服性”，甚至还在假设父母肯定见识浅短，觉得这很容易办到——很多人的理论还是建立在自己（或身边的某人）就“办到过”的基础上。", "char_start": 1438, "char_end": 1539}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "首先，你自己（或曰你的“朋友”）恐怕并非“向大一女儿表白的中专毕业生”，你们也未必是在面对一个“对方父母已经决绝的处在被高度激怒状态”的局面，整个游戏的开局根本就不同。", "char_start": 1540, "char_end": 1624}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "第二，这种“只要xx一下就行了”的轻浮态度本身就是致命的——不要觉得人家父母多活的三十年是在吃干饭，人家不需要懂什么技术，仅仅凭着你这“神采飞扬”的“自信态度”，就已经知道你不难对付。", "char_start": 1625, "char_end": 1717}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "因为ta们可非常清楚，要对付的根本就不是你，而是ta们的女儿。", "char_start": 1718, "char_end": 1749}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "ta们只是要在现场诱导你说出、做出一些ta们的女儿绝不能容忍、绝对无法接受的话和事而已。而ta们的优势是非常明显的——ta们恐怕远比你更清楚致命的禁区和按钮在哪。", "char_start": 1750, "char_end": 1831}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "毕竟ta们是亲眼看着自己女儿长大的人。", "char_start": 1832, "char_end": 1851}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "随口问你几句关于虐猫的态度，或者对于穿衣风格、妆容、朋友相处的伦理之类的看法，你都有可能无意间踩到女孩子的绝对红线。", "char_start": 1852, "char_end": 1910}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "那些红线你还根本不知道——你才跟她交往几天？你上哪去知道？", "char_start": 1911, "char_end": 1940}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你越自信，一旦踩到这些红线，你就死得越透。你去把对方父母“镇住”没有任何意义，不该说的话你已经说了，你已经把女孩本身浇了个透心凉。", "char_start": 1941, "char_end": 2006}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "至于对方父母，恐怕一开始就没什么“可镇住性”，你不理解父母对想吃天鹅肉的癞蛤蟆是什么样的憎恨，你这就像在谈论“绑匪用口才说服人质家属放下心结”。", "char_start": 2007, "char_end": 2079}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你会觉得这是可能的，本身都意味着成功率接近于零。你觉得这基本不现实，反倒可能因为“哀兵”身份多点胜算。", "char_start": 2080, "char_end": 2131}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "其实正确的、能提高胜算的态度当然有，但是俺不乐意说。", "char_start": 2132, "char_end": 2158}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "哼，这又不是泡方便面，还要给你配个图解说明。这是要吃天鹅肉，当然要靠你自己悟出来才算，蛤蟆君。", "char_start": 2159, "char_end": 2206}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "自己悟去。", "char_start": 2207, "char_end": 2212}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 40}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0303"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中专毕业的男生向大一女儿表白，女儿想试试，作为家长我是不同意的，应该怎么和女儿说好一些?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040"], "summary": "围绕“拆散”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实很简单，请女儿带对方来吃顿饭见个面就行了——大部分的小孩都扛不住“见对方父母”这个压力。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实很简单，请女儿带对方来吃顿饭见个面就行了——大部分的小孩都扛不住“见对方父母”这个压力。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2b80c970-eb3d-5f10-beb5-61d782c06302", "source_ordinal": 2013, "reading_ordinal": 2043, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "贵亲", "published_at": "2023-09-18T20:24:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/601067687/answer/3216720282"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "开价，两千一天——然后友好的提醒ta，租车公司更便宜且方便。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "认定亲友比商业化服务成本更低，是对亲友的一种欺凌——如果真的成本低，亲友为啥不做这个生意赚钱呢？", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "既然成本更高，为啥价格反倒会比市价便宜？", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这都是不可能的事。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所谓帮忙，是指在不亏损的前提下肯为你经营这个额外业务，你照价支付，还要感谢我为你做了这件事。", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "站在你的立场上看，你的确是不如去采购市场服务。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 181}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0303"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：买了一辆40多万的车，亲戚连续3周给我打电话借车，又不能直接拒绝，怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“贵亲”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“开价，两千一天——然后友好的提醒ta，租车公司更便宜且方便。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "开价，两千一天——然后友好的提醒ta，租车公司更便宜且方便。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6c5333d3-dc83-5655-88e7-cdab43a9969b", "source_ordinal": 2012, "reading_ordinal": 2044, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不置可否", "published_at": "2023-09-19T01:49:29+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/528565862/answer/3217028046"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "家长引导子女的行为，要警惕一种战略性的错误，就是“管太多”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个问题其实在以前谈论律法主义问题的时候谈过，那就是立法是有极高的成本的，一旦立法，司法就要保证质量，就要处理释法、上诉等等一连串的问题。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而如果你在某处没有立法，索性当作没看见，那么就自然不存在违规、也就不存在执法成本，也不存在司法信用问题，也不存在一系列的成本问题。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "乱立法，很容易就会突破你的资源极限，导致实际上的有法不依、执法不严，作为管理者的信用动摇，丧失权威性和影响力。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 222}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "立法是一件极其富有智慧的事，“有所不为”的要害性反而在“有所为”之前。", "char_start": 223, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "为此，你必须策略性的放弃一些点，必须要集中资源到战略要地。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一旦你控制狂发作，想要扩张兵力搞大扫荡，你就脑补一下中心城市因为兵力分散失守的后果。比如，你要管到子女吃饭怎么夹菜、拿手机用什么姿势，可以，那么你就要做好准备将来拿“ta非要跟混混交往，你以死相逼都不理你”换。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "因为你的权威性和严肃性早已在这种“地毯式大扫荡”里破产了，你到时候再发现你没有影响力可用了，你就要记住，这是你自己长期明知故犯造成的，完全是你自己活该。", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "到时候你一万个愿意用三吨哈密瓜来换ta肯听你一句劝，但那时已悔之晚矣。", "char_start": 472, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "权威性和严肃性不是来自法条绵密，而是来自“执法必严，言出必行”。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 540}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而执法必严和言出必行，在你资源有限的前提下，必然以“立法简洁”为绝对前提。刘邦势弱，所以约法仅三章。这是数学，不以人的意志为转移。", "char_start": 541, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这还只是从上位者的视角来看。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 621}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "从下位者守法的视角来看，当你把法条缩小到十条，那么哪一条被违背了都会产生强烈的道德驱动，促使当事人自责。", "char_start": 622, "char_end": 674}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但当你把法条扩张到八百条，那么可以现实的讲——随时随地，有某条正在被违反将成为一个常态。守法者要守法也是有资源分配问题的，你把ta要面对的问题复杂化到一定程度，违反、触犯就是必然的行为，自责、内疚就会不可避免的自然消亡。", "char_start": 675, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而人的自责和内疚才是法律得以被积极执行，监管得以可持续运行的最大的保证——不是你的威慑和所谓的惩罚。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "一切的监护人立法，在不遵循这个战略原则的前提下盲目的追求战术利益，都是不折不扣的愚蠢行为，失败的父母十之八九是败在这条上。", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 898}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这也不稀奇——人的失败总是从自居为神开始。自居为神的父母，当然不会有什么“资源有限”的意识，自然而然的会觉得每一点战术性收益都没有理由放过。ta们循着这样的傲慢，积极主动的将宝贵的威信资源浪费在微不足道、鸡毛蒜皮的小事上，以至于飞快的走向影响力彻底破产，几乎毫无悬念。", "char_start": 899, "char_end": 1033}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你问哈密瓜该不该啃干净？当然该。", "char_start": 1035, "char_end": 1051}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "该不该出声去管？不该。", "char_start": 1052, "char_end": 1063}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为你真要管制这类浪费食物的行为，用不着去苦口婆心的教育，只需要利用自己的伙食安排权，直接减少食物配额，保证每一顿都会饿就可以了。你看一个饿宝宝会不会给你啃干净。", "char_start": 1064, "char_end": 1145}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "吃不干净，就是给你太多了。饿汉子永远珍惜食物，还用得着谁来说服？", "char_start": 1146, "char_end": 1178}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "聪明的父母，总是先动用行政手段直接抹去不希望的情况出现的逻辑前提，只有最后才会动用“立法权”这种高成本的稀缺资源去对付足以影响信仰和价值观的问题。", "char_start": 1179, "char_end": 1252}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "动用立法权要解决的问题，必须是根本价值观问题，是诫命级别的问题。", "char_start": 1253, "char_end": 1285}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "何谓“诫命”级别？这个你可以参考一下各种意识形态里的“七诫”“十诫”“十恶不赦”“四维”“八德”之类的样本，自己有个概念——这不是叫你直接照抄，而是让你知道一下，值得动用整套立法、释法、司法、上诉……这么高成本来确立和巩固的东西，大概是个什么级别。", "char_start": 1286, "char_end": 1410}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这种神器你拿来节省哈密瓜……哈密瓜都醉了。", "char_start": 1411, "char_end": 1432}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0303"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：小朋友吃哈密瓜，允许她只吃上面甜的半截，算溺爱吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“不置可否”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“家长引导子女的行为，要警惕一种战略性的错误，就是“管太多”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "家长引导子女的行为，要警惕一种战略性的错误，就是“管太多”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
